  "claim": {
    "component_id": "C039.component",
    "value": "A rise confined to one equipment type supports a narrower trial.",
    "scope": "Conditional on observing a type-confined rise. The particular rising delay measure and exact trial boundaries are unspecified. This is practical trial selection, not statistical proof or causal identification; options must fit existing equipment and staffing.",
