      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "P021 explicitly supplies the equipment-specific condition and narrower-trial implication. P025 and P013 supply the practical and resource bounds."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C039.signal_basis",
    "value": "Repeated comparable booking observations show a rising delay pattern confined to one equipment type, assessed across comparable equipment and crew groups using late-start rates, delay minutes, stage counts and recording completeness.",
    "scope": "The signal is assumed observed for this judgment. Sparse bookings or missing records capable of reversing the ranking require the mapping's recording-and-handoff fallback. Measurement errors, workload, job mix and concurrent interventions can distort patterns; the short investigation provides practical selection evidence.",
